{"seq":46,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2674"},"reason":"The HydroLAKES result (about 62 % of the world's lakes in Canada) applies only to lakes of 10 ha or more; Snopes notes Canada does not hold more lakes than the rest of the world once smaller lakes are counted, though it has the most of any country. Body sentence and table row narrowed accordingly.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.cbc.ca/news/science/canada-has-the-most-lakes-of-any-country-but-we-know-very-little-1.3898162"},{"url":"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/canada-lakes/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",380],["-","natural "],["=",2],["+","of that size "],["=",6],["-","**Canada**."],["+","**Canada**;"],["=",1],["+","counting every small pond as well, the share is far lower, but no country has more lakes. "],["=",220],["-","natural "],["=",20],["+","lakes of 10 ha+ "],["=",55]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",330],["-","natürlichen "],["=",2],["-","der"],["+","dieser"],["=",1],["-","Welt"],["+","Größe"],["=",1],["+","weltweit "],["=",6],["-","liegen."],["+","liegen;"],["=",1],["+","zählt man auch jeden kleinen Teich mit, ist der Anteil weit geringer, doch kein Land hat mehr Seen. "],["=",202],["-","natürliche "],["=",18],["+","ab 10 ha "],["=",53]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",332],["-","природных "],["=",2],["-","мира"],["+","такого"],["=",1],["+","размера в мире "],["=",18],["-","**Канада**."],["+","**Канада**;"],["=",1],["+","если считать и самые маленькие пруды, доля гораздо меньше, но ни в одной стране нет больше озёр. "],["=",216],["-","природных "],["=",16],["+","озёр от 10 га "],["=",59]]}],"actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"5be65b693126ec0b15e59f637c60e8123fb955198b281fd0f71fe81135f6a518"},
{"seq":47,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2674"},"reason":"Player-facing note explaining that the card's 'more than half of all natural lakes' holds only for lakes of 10 ha or more.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/canada-lakes/"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"The card said “more than half of all the world's natural lakes”; that holds only for lakes of ten hectares or more (HydroLAKES) – counting smaller lakes, Canada's share is far lower, though it still has more lakes than any other country."},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["+","Die Karte sprach von „mehr als der Hälfte aller natürlichen Seen der Welt“; das gilt nur für Seen ab zehn Hektar (HydroLAKES) – zählt man kleinere Seen mit, ist Kanadas Anteil weit geringer, auch wenn es weiterhin mehr Seen hat als jedes andere Land."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["+","На карточке говорилось о «больше чем половине всех природных озёр мира»; это верно только для озёр площадью от десяти гектаров (HydroLAKES) — если считать и меньшие озёра, доля Канады гораздо ниже, хотя озёр в ней всё равно больше, чем в любой другой стране."]]}],"hash":"90d7f03ba96f","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"50d93da91aad84e20a337bd958249d0ddf3c0cc56be0ac26569766d725e0b20c"},
