{"seq":49,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w14830"},"reason":"'More than half of all the world's natural lakes' is true only for lakes of ten hectares or more (HydroLAKES); the question now says so. Card text kept in cardText.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.cbc.ca/news/science/canada-has-the-most-lakes-of-any-country-but-we-know-very-little-1.3898162"},{"url":"https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/canada-lakes/"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"In which large, cold country are more than half of all the world's natural lakes located?","new":"In which large, cold country do more than half of the world's lakes of ten hectares or more lie?"},{"field":"de","old":"In welchem großen, kalten Land liegen mehr als die Hälfte aller natürlichen Seen der Welt?","new":"In welchem großen, kalten Land liegt mehr als die Hälfte aller Seen der Welt mit mindestens zehn Hektar Fläche?"},{"field":"ru","old":"В какой большой холодной стране находится больше половины всех природных озёр мира?","new":"В какой большой холодной стране находится больше половины всех озёр мира площадью от десяти гектаров?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"In welchem großen, kalten Land liegen mehr als die Hälfte aller natürlichen Seen der Welt?"}],"hash":"708bc4ee223e","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"a7cf4c1b05dfd421c2097bcfc9dc72b0965f1e6ef3033950e58bf19119fc2b07"},
